WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.044
- Painting this galaxy
on my nails, I think,

00:00:02.044 --> 00:00:05.240
is probably harder than actually
flying into outer space.

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.440
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.698 --> 00:00:09.875
I'm just gonna go for it, I'm just gonna

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:12.115
put the polish on the sponge.

00:00:12.115 --> 00:00:15.052
They did it really neatly,
I don't see that happening.

00:00:15.052 --> 00:00:16.262
It's just blobs.

00:00:16.262 --> 00:00:17.020
It'll get there.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.854
It's actually really pretty.

00:00:18.854 --> 00:00:20.851
Never give up on yourself.

00:00:20.851 --> 00:00:22.569
I'm gonna start Pinteresting.

00:00:22.569 --> 00:00:24.055
I really think that this pink is gonna,

00:00:24.055 --> 00:00:26.168
like, make this entire thing pop.

00:00:26.168 --> 00:00:29.930
Aww man, that was so disappointing.

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:33.741
Every time I put on a layer,
it covered up the last layer.

00:00:33.741 --> 00:00:35.176
How am I gonna do my right hand?

00:00:35.176 --> 00:00:36.740
I think they were prettier without it,

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:37.755
I shouldn't have done it.

00:00:37.755 --> 00:00:40.151
Look how beautiful it
looks without the stars.

00:00:40.151 --> 00:00:42.914
And look how dumb it
looks with these stars.

00:00:45.989 --> 00:00:47.112
- I have absolutely no confidence

00:00:47.112 --> 00:00:49.457
in myself being able to do this.

00:00:49.457 --> 00:00:50.850
This is gonna be bad.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.497
Now I think I put the different colors

00:00:53.497 --> 00:00:55.905
of the ombre on the sponge.

00:00:55.905 --> 00:00:57.247
I have my stripes.

00:00:57.247 --> 00:00:59.313
This is gonna go terribly, I can tell.

00:00:59.313 --> 00:01:03.237
Oh my god, this looks so, so bad.

00:01:03.237 --> 00:01:04.723
I've never been good at Pinterest.

00:01:04.723 --> 00:01:06.093
Take two.

00:01:06.093 --> 00:01:08.183
Oh, look at that!

00:01:08.183 --> 00:01:09.785
(laughs)

00:01:09.785 --> 00:01:11.649
It's not ugly.

00:01:11.649 --> 00:01:14.492
It's also not what I was going for.

00:01:16.319 --> 00:01:17.825
- I'm an art major, so I feel like

00:01:17.825 --> 00:01:19.868
I should be able to do this.

00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:22.446
It already doesn't look like the picture.

00:01:22.446 --> 00:01:23.738
Here we go.

00:01:23.738 --> 00:01:24.633
Woah!

00:01:24.633 --> 00:01:26.351
It's not quite like the picture,

00:01:26.351 --> 00:01:29.045
but some good stuff was happening.

00:01:29.045 --> 00:01:31.042
Going in for, now, number 2.

00:01:31.042 --> 00:01:33.038
Oh no.

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:36.212
Something went wrong.

00:01:36.212 --> 00:01:37.752
This isn't good, guys.

00:01:37.752 --> 00:01:40.608
I am going to have to
clean up a whole lot.

00:01:40.608 --> 00:01:43.046
I have a lot of respect
for the people on Pinterest

00:01:43.046 --> 00:01:47.965
who can do this, because I
can't, and I'm an art major.

00:01:49.879 --> 00:01:51.389
- I don't think it's gonna be easy,

00:01:51.389 --> 00:01:53.293
I think it's gonna be
really time consuming,

00:01:53.293 --> 00:01:56.312
But ultimately, worth it.

00:01:56.312 --> 00:01:58.674
My fear is like, I put the tape on,

00:01:58.674 --> 00:01:59.407
and then I rip it off and then

00:01:59.407 --> 00:02:00.752
I have no nail polish underneath.

00:02:00.752 --> 00:02:02.660
Putting on the tape is actually
way crazier than I thought.

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:04.495
I'm gonna have to like, measure this.

00:02:04.495 --> 00:02:05.772
This is like surgery.

00:02:05.772 --> 00:02:07.467
This is like, who has time for this?

00:02:07.467 --> 00:02:09.115
The other hand is gonna
be a complete disaster,

00:02:09.115 --> 00:02:10.461
I can already tell you right now.

00:02:10.461 --> 00:02:11.855
Oh, I totally skipped a finger.

00:02:11.855 --> 00:02:13.248
I totally forgot about my finger.

00:02:13.248 --> 00:02:14.456
You know what, I probably would've

00:02:14.456 --> 00:02:15.849
been better at freestyling this.

00:02:15.849 --> 00:02:17.358
Tape is so hard.

00:02:17.358 --> 00:02:19.429
Oh my god, and I have to
cut it with my left hand.

00:02:19.429 --> 00:02:20.462
How long has it been?

00:02:20.462 --> 00:02:23.425
I can't remember a time before this.

00:02:23.425 --> 00:02:25.130
Okay, not too bad!

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:27.080
Okay, this hand is done.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.218
This is pretty cool.

00:02:28.218 --> 00:02:30.310
There's something there.

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:32.389
I would say you need a good 3 hours.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:34.585
- This is that thing you do now,

00:02:34.585 --> 00:02:36.327
like when your nails
are wet, and you like,

00:02:36.327 --> 00:02:39.531
you don't wanna, like, touch
anything, or grab anything.

00:02:39.531 --> 00:02:42.169
Yep, I already (bleep) this one up.

00:02:42.169 --> 00:02:43.943
I don't know how they fit
so many dots on one nail.

00:02:43.943 --> 00:02:45.615
And that nail is shorter than mine.

00:02:45.615 --> 00:02:47.124
I will say, this is very relaxing.

00:02:47.124 --> 00:02:49.980
Okay, I'm gonna try to
get like, a thin line.

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:52.581
Looks like those paintings
people think are vaginas.

00:02:52.581 --> 00:02:55.145
I bet if we did a video like this of like,

00:02:55.145 --> 00:02:56.027
doing your nails while you're drunk,

00:02:56.027 --> 00:02:57.878
it would still look exactly like this.

00:02:57.878 --> 00:02:59.503
Remember when I said this was relaxing?

00:02:59.503 --> 00:03:00.711
Now I'm finding it tedious.

00:03:00.711 --> 00:03:02.632
The green helps a lot, to like, be like,

00:03:02.632 --> 00:03:04.028
hey look, this is a flower.

00:03:04.028 --> 00:03:05.027
I would do this again.

00:03:05.027 --> 00:03:08.402
I might just do, like, an
accent nail on each hand.

00:03:08.402 --> 00:03:10.865
Because I think this
is also kind of a lot.

00:03:15.093 --> 00:03:16.292
- [Voiceover] I think no one looks good

00:03:16.292 --> 00:03:17.135
when they paint their own nails.

00:03:17.135 --> 00:03:19.329
We all look like we just learned

00:03:19.329 --> 00:03:20.973
that we had opposable
thumbs, or something.

00:03:20.973 --> 00:03:24.286
And like, just figuring
them out for the first time.

